{title: Kannaana Kanney}
{artist: Sid Sriram Viswasam}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D]Kannaana kanne,        [D]Kannaana kanne
[A]En meedhu s [Gm]aaya v [A]aa [D],        [D]Punnaana nenjai
[D]Ponnaana kaiyaal,        [A]Poo pola [Gm]neeva va [A]a [D]
[D]Naan kaathu nindren,        [G]Kaalangal dhorum
En yekkam t [A]heerumaa,        [D]Naan paarthu ni [Bm]ndren
Pon vaanam e [G]ngum,        [G]En minnal tho [A]ndrumaa
Thaneeraai me [D]gam thoorum,        Kanneer s [Gm]erum
[A]Karkandaai maarumaa,        Aaraari ra [D]aroo
Raaroo raa [Bm]roo aaraari ra [G]aroo,        [G]Aaraari raaroo raaroo raaroo
