[D]Punnaana nenjai,        [D]Ponnaana kaiyaal
[A]Poo pola [Gm]neeva va [A]a [D],        [D]Alai kadalin naduve
[D]Alainthidavaa thaniye,        [G]Padagenavae unaiye
[D]Paarthen kanne,        [D]Puthai manalil veezhunthu
[Gm]Puthainthidave irunthen,        [A]Kuru nagayai erinthe
[A]Meettaai enna [D]mi,        [D]Vinnodum mannodum vaadum
