Enai [Gm]etho bayam ko [D]odum,        Mayil [G]ondrai paark [D]kiren
Mazhaiy [G]aagi aadine [D]n,        Indha ur [G]chaagam pothum
S [A#]aaga thondrum id [Gm]hae vi [D]naad [A]i,        [D]Kannaana kanne
[D]Kannaana kanne,        [A]En meedhu s [Gm]aaya v [A]aa [D]
[D]Punnaana nenjai,        [D]Ponnaana kaiyaal
